{"unit_id":"ljsysfurryACE__dsh-aura-scheduler#card-zh","repo":"ljsysfurryACE/dsh-aura-scheduler","commit":"f9048cd59399dbc2b38b0d3be4a750342b8b72ca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-aura-scheduler 是供 DSH 使用的后台主动调度插件：它把调度服务挂到 ctx.aura，并可在启动后按心跳周期判断是否应主动发出事件。它结合空闲时长、相关性、打扰成本、静默时段、冷却时间和可选低谷时段作出触发判断，也能轮询文件、进程、HTTP 响应或端口状态变化，并通过已注册的 Webhook 接收签名请求触发任务。主动事件可经 DSH 事件回调或配置的 HTTP 地址发送，服务还提供状态查询和手动 tick。适合希望按时间或外部状态自动唤起 DSH agent 的使用场景；无需固定 API 密钥，Webhook 密钥可自动生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:106-123","src/index.ts:135-163","src/index.ts:194-245","src/sensors.ts:30-59","src/webhook.ts:34-88"]}
{"unit_id":"ljsysfurryACE__dsh-aura-scheduler#card-en","repo":"ljsysfurryACE/dsh-aura-scheduler","commit":"f9048cd59399dbc2b38b0d3be4a750342b8b72ca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-aura-scheduler adds a proactive heartbeat service to DSH. It considers idle time, quiet hours, cooldown, and optional off-peak windows before emitting events. File, process, HTTP, port changes, and signed webhooks can also trigger the agent. Events use a DSH callback or configured HTTP URL.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:106-123","src/index.ts:135-163","src/index.ts:194-245","src/sensors.ts:30-59","src/webhook.ts:34-88"]}
